    "scope": "All 78 CI captures from run 43908122491's visual job, attempts 1 and 2 (artifacts 14246384349 and 14264415381), on Clockgrove aa9c8c4. The two attempts agree on every digest. 13 states x 3 viewports x WebGPU/WebGL2.",
